<title>ITALY: Gross yield rises at Italy 30-yr Btp sale.</title>
<headline>Gross yield rises at Italy 30-yr Btp sale.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a fifth tranche of 1.0 trillion lire worth of a 30-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (Btp) with a 7.25 pct coupon.</p>
<p>		     Nov 1, 2026	    Pvs</p>
<p> Net Yield	 7.35 pct		 6.95 pct</p>
<p> Gross Yield     8.39 pct		 7.94</p>
<p> Assigned price 89.20		    93.70</p>
<p> Bids	     2.040 trln lire</p>
<p> Assigned	 1.000 trln lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparison is with the previous auction of a third tranche of the 30-year Btp on February 27.</p>
</text>
